          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 73126,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arkadaşlarının her biri için bir değişken oluşturmak kodunu uzun ve karmaşık hâle getirirdi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend3 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>friend1</code>, ardından <code>friend2</code> ve son olarak <code>friend3</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arkadaşlarının her biri için bir değişken oluşturmak kodunu uzun ve karmaşık hâle getirirdi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend3 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"friends\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"friend\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"friend4\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>friend1</code>, ardından <code>friend2</code> ve son olarak <code>friend3</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Square brackets",
            "id": 73127,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Her arkadaşının adı için bir değişken oluşturmak yerine, tüm değerleri <code>[</code> ve <code>]</code> kullanarak bir <strong>dizi</strong> içinde gruplayabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tom', 'Mia', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Her arkadaşının adı için bir değişken oluşturmak yerine tüm değerleri <code>[</code> ve <code>]</code> kullanarak bir <strong>dizi</strong> içinde gruplayabiliriz. Bildirimi, üç arkadaşı bir dizi olarak kaydedecek şekilde tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tom', 'Mia', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Element",
            "id": 73901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir dizinin değerlerine <strong>öğe</strong> denir. Örneğin <code>\"Tom\"</code>, <code>\"Mia\"</code> ve <code>\"Lee\"</code> bu dizinin öğeleridir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tom', 'Mia', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Lee\"</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
