            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir diziye istediğin sayıda değer sığar. Virgül ve ardından değeri yazarak daha fazlasını ekleriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tom', 'Mia', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>\"Lee\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir diziye istediğin sayıda değer sığar. Virgül <code>,</code> ve ardından değeri kodlayarak başka bir değer ekle.</p><p>Diziyi sırasıyla <code>\"Tom\"</code>, <code>\"Mia\"</code> ve <code>\"Lee\"</code> kaydedecek şekilde genişlet.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Lee\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tom', 'Mia', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>\"Lee\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
